   "stimulus_html": "<table><tbody><tr>\n<td>Medium</td>\n<td>v<sub>w</sub> (m/s)</td>\n</tr>\n\n</tbody><tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b><i>Gases at 0 °C</i></b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Air</td>\n<td>331</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Carbon dioxide</td>\n<td>259</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Oxygen</td>\n<td>316</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Helium</td>\n<td>965</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hydrogen</td>\n<td>1290</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><i>Liquids at 20 °C</i></b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ethanol</td>\n<td>1160</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Mercury</td>\n<td>1450</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water, fresh</td>\n<td>1480</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sea water</td>\n<td>1540</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Human tissue</td>\n<td>1540</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><i>Solids (longitudinal or bulk)</i></b></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Vulcanized rubber</td>\n<td>54</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Polyethylene</td>\n<td>920</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Marble</td>\n<td>3810</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Glass, Pyrex</td>\n<td>5640</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lead</td>\n<td>1960</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aluminum</td>\n<td>5120</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Steel</td>\n<td>5960</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
   "stem_html": "A sound wave with a frequency of 80 Hz is traveling through air at  0°C. The sound wave enters a block of aluminum. If the sound's frequency does not change, what happens to the sound's wavelength?",
